// Positions in a source text, as the lexer counts them (card self-differential)
// DONE code_points(line) These are probably calculated elsewhere too and can be optimized? (card code-points-once)
// (line_widths is gone; each caller takes a source's code points once, the parser a single grapheme's)

// The code points of a text as a list
def code_points(text: text): list := [point for point in text.codepoints]
